/pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Fine-tuned chatbots seem to work as well as humans for mental health treatments in this RCT]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p>URL: <a href="https://ai.nejm.org/doi/10.1056/AIoa2400802">https://ai.nejm.org/doi/10.1056/AIoa2400802</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/03/monday-assorted-links-502.html?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=monday-assorted-links-502">Monday assorted links</a></p>]]></description><link>https://ai.nejm.org/doi/10.1056/AIoa2400802</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://ai.nejm.org/doi/10.1056/AIoa2400802</guid><pubDate>Mon, 31 Mar 2025 15:43:56 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[The decline in publicly listed companies is microcaps]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/GV_v09tWgAA8LIe.png:large"></p><p>modest proposal (@modestproposal1) on X</p><p>Updated the US listed companies analysis. You can clearly see the impact of the SPAC/IPO boom of 2020-21. Reminder, I exclude sub $100M mkt cap, stepped in 2005/15/20, to adjust for inflation. Conclusion remains, the decline in listings is microcaps.</p><p>URL: <a href="https://x.com/modestproposal1/status/1828444220505424343?s=46&t=MjnX_DXTQJUzZBI6imUASg">https://x.com/modestproposal1/status/1828444220505424343?s=46&t=MjnX_DXTQJUzZBI6imUASg</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/03/monday-assorted-links-502.html?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=monday-assorted-links-502">Monday assorted links</a></p>]]></description><link>https://x.com/modestproposal1/status/1828444220505424343?s=46&amp;t=MjnX_DXTQJUzZBI6imUASg</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://x.com/modestproposal1/status/1828444220505424343?s=46&amp;t=MjnX_DXTQJUzZBI6imUASg</guid><pubDate>Mon, 31 Mar 2025 15:43:56 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[The pro-natalist movement in the Trump administration is now being treated by the NYT as a normie thing]]