d reflections on generative ai</p><p>URL: <a href="https://x.com/EMostaque/status/1906370813739274388">https://x.com/EMostaque/status/1906370813739274388</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/03/monday-assorted-links-502.html?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=monday-assorted-links-502">Monday assorted links</a></p>]]></description><link>https://x.com/EMostaque/status/1906370813739274388</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://x.com/EMostaque/status/1906370813739274388</guid><pubDate>Mon, 31 Mar 2025 15:43:56 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[A poll on which is your favorite Odyssey translation]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1857140980421668864/0prdKK32_200x200.jpg"></p><p>Nabeel S. Qureshi (@nabeelqu) on X</p><p>Doing an experiment. Below are four translations of a passage in the Odyssey. Read all four then vote in the poll which is your favorite. (Context: Calypso, immortal goddess, has asked Odysseus to stay with her forever on her island and be immortal; this is his response.)</p><p>URL: <a href="https://x.com/nabeelqu/status/1906455060088840629">https://x.com/nabeelqu/status/1906455060088840629</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/03/monday-assorted-links-502.html?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=monday-assorted-links-502">Monday assorted links</a></p>]]></description><link>https://x.com/nabeelqu/status/1906455060088840629</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://x.com/nabeelqu/status/1906455060088840629</guid><pubDate>Mon, 31 Mar 2025 15:43:56 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Our results suggest that the recent stagnation of the college wage premium primarily reflects demand factors, specifically a slowdown in the pace of skill biased technological change.]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p>URL: <a href="https://www.frbsf.org/research-and-insights/publications/working-papers/2025/01/explaini